\**{c=red:Note:}** The game may freeze during the upcoming cutscenes depending on your Windower/Ashita settings.
* The FastCS addon crashes this cutscene.
* FPS needs to be capped at 30 (if you changed it). If using Windower, use //config FrameRateDivisor 2.
* If it does freeze, you can run `//lua unloadall` then `//exec autoload/autoload`, and it should recover from the frozen cutscene.
* Pressing Print Screen Key may also possibly break you out of soft lock.

=2 Preparation
* **{c=red:Note:}** Before heading out to {z:Arrapago Reef}, you will need to obtain a {@i:Hamsi|5449} {i:Hamsi|Hamsi|5449}.
** This can be purchased from {n:Wahnid} (H-11) in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate}, bought from the {z:Auction House} or easily fished from {p:Aht Urghan Whitegate} with zero fishing skill.
** Wahnid is open from 1:00-18:00, closed on {p:Lightsday}.
*** The item is __not automatically restocked__. It is only available if previously sold to the guild.
* You will also need a {@i:Lamian Fang Key|2219} {i:Lamian Fang Key|Lamian Fang Key|2219}. Alternatively, {p:Thief} can use {i:Skeleton Key|Skeleton Key|1115} and or {i:Thief Tools|Thief's Tools|1022}.
** You can obtain the key by examining the **???** once per game day at (I-7) in {z:Caedarva Mire} Map 1 (in the vicinity of the small pond containing {m:Jnun}).
** You will need at least 2 more keys for the upcoming steps, so if you are with multiple people/characters, each one should grab a key.
** The Survival Guide teleport to {z:Arrapago Reef} (via Arrapago Is.) and running south will exit to {z:Caedarva Mire} (I-6).
*** {s:Escape} from {z:Arrapago Reef} will put you in {z:Caedarva Mire} (I-6) as well.
*** Alternatively, you can use the {z:Azouph Isle Staging Point} (Leujaoam Sanctum), exit {z:Nashmau} at (H-6) or use the {p:Voidwatch} warp to Caedarva Mire.

=2 Walkthrough
