* Head to {z:Arrapago Reef} Map 1 and interact with the **???** at the North East corner of (H-10) on a ship for a cutscene to begin the Mission.
** This is easiest via the {z:Arrapago Reef} {p:Survival Guide}. Alternatively, from where you obtained the {@i:Lamian Fang Key|2219} Lamian Fang Key, head to (I-6) to zone into {z:Arrapago Reef}.
*** From there, move towards (J-10) with a {@i:Lamian Fang Key|2219} {i:Lamian Fang Key|Lamian Fang Key|2219} to open the **Iron Gate**. Trade the key, and quickly cross through.
*** **Hug the left wall** on this cavern map. You will exit through a door back to the first Map, and you'll you reach (H-10).
** The **???** target is the same for the {p:Corsair} Job quest: at the center of the ships bow, immediately __left__ of the glowing, nameless target.
** The correct cutscene mentions Pteraketos and Sealord Skin.
* After the cutscene, head to Map 3 of Arrapago Reef (F-7), and trade a {@i:Hamsi|5449} {i:Hamsi|Hamsi|5449} to the {n:Apkallu Guide} for another cutscene.
** The fastest way to get to this location is to warp out and use a {p:Survival Guide} to teleport to {z:Caedarva Mire}, then immediately enter the cave into {z:Arrapago Reef}.
** **Note**: If you don't have the Caedarva Mire {p:Survival Guide}, you will need another {@i:Lamian Fang Key|2219} {i:Lamian Fang Key|Lamian Fang Key|2219} to reach it.

[Directions for if you are missing the Survival Guide
* If you lack the Caedarva Mire Survival Guide, either walk from the prior cutscene area, or return to town and warp to {p:Ilrusi Atoll Staging Point}.
* Assuming that you're starting from the prior area:
** From the ship you are on now (Map 1), proceed to (F-10) to cross over to Map 2 (B).
*** This is the same map as if you take the {p:Ilrusi Atoll Staging Point}, and the paths converge at the next point.
** Proceed to (D-10) to cross over to Map 3 (C).
** Continue to (F-9) to use a {@i:Lamian Fang Key|2219} {i:Lamian Fang Key|Lamian Fang Key|2219} on door "**E**".
** Through the gate, turn right and go through another gate.
** Wind your way around to (F-6) and zone to obtain the {p:Survival Guide} warp in Caedarva Mire. **You will need it for the next Mission too.**
** Return to the Reef to (F-7) to trade a {@i:Hamsi|5449} {i:Hamsi|Hamsi|5449} to the {n:Apkallu Guide} for a cutscene and resume the Mission.

]
* After the cutscene with the {n:Apkallu Guide}, head west and click the **Camp Remnants** (F-7) to begin a confrontation with:

>**Encounter**
* 2 {p:Merrow Kabukidancers|Category:Lamiae} (SAM)
** Merrows can {p:strip your gear|Encumbrance} with Torrent.
** Torrent is a {@g:Magical Damage|Magical} {@g:Element: Water|Water} move which can be evaded with gear __and__ water specific evasion.
* 2 {p:Qutrub|Category:Qutrub} (DRK)
* 2 {p:Mamool Ja Divers (Sahagin)|Category:Sahagin} (MNK)
** {p:Trusts|Category:Trust} may be used. Call them BEFORE checking the **Camp Remnants**.
** It is not a difficult fight overall with a trust healer/support and Malignance/Empyrean +2/3 or Nyame R0.
** AoEs behave abnormally in this fight and only hit the primary target, meaning that AoE sleep/petrification will not work.
*** Because of this, make sure that you're buffed and have {p:DT} equipment on before popping if you're using trusts.
*** The foes can still be individually slept if you so choose, except for the Qutrubs.

* After the fight, click the **Camp Remnants** again for a cutscene.
** **{c=red:Note:}** **FastCS will soft-lock your client to a black screen at the end of this cutscene.**
*** To resolve this, upon reaching the aforementioned black screen, hold **Prt Scr** (or **Fn** + **Prt Scr** if on laptop or a 60% keyboard) for ~2 seconds to unlock yourself from the soft-lock.
* Return to the **???** on the Corsair ship at (H-10) Map 1 of Arrapago Reef for the final cutscene and your reward.
** You can obtain another {@i:Lamian Fang Key|2219} {i:Lamian Fang Key|Lamian Fang Key|2219} from the **???** in {z:Caedarva Mire} map 1 at (I-7) if the game day has rolled over straight outside of Arrapago Reef.
** Alternatively, you can simply walk back. From the **Camp Remnants**: go to **C** to reach Map 2. From there, go to **B**. From there you can reach the Corsair ship.

